            "review_title": "Review at Đa Lat Oi",
            "review_text": "Thanh L. H.\n5 contributions\n0\nPlease give it 6 stars.\nMay 2024 • Solo\nI love this place. I wish I could say less than a hundred words. But really, no words can describe. They served what was known to me as a gift from heaven. I would've cried eating in solitude. But I was glad they sat me down, gave me a drink, and asked me if I wanted to know how to eat it proper way. I'll come back.\nInsider tip:\nIf Khoa is there, tell him I said hi. The legend.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 5, 2024",
